      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "design tell",
      "narration_text": "Here is the Teardown moment. forecasting is a specification written as an instruction set. Claude's job: How to produce a demand forecast for a SKU, and when to delegate that to a subagent vs. compute it yourself. What it gets right: repeatable results. What it bites: anything outside the spec.",
