    {
      "beat_id": "BVDT",
      "act": "verdict",
      "narration_text": "Path A or Path B: the decision is in the flags — seasonal, promo, horizon. Confidence below 0.6 means escalate, not auto-order — that threshold is the spec's own failure condition. The forecast quantity is what the rolling mean computed; it is not a fact about next month. Same flags, same path, same number. That's the deal.",
